# {whatsapp,wechaty,qqbot}.service.ts still typecheck against them (`typeof import(...)` /
# `await import(...)`). Remove these three optionalDependencies together with those dead
# channel services, then delete this override and the per-command flags in ci.yml,
# vercel.json and the root install:deps script.
